        <h1>Two reasons to amend Form 2290 — weight increase or mileage exceeded</h1>
        <p>An amendment updates an already-accepted Form 2290 without refiling from scratch. TruckTaxPro e-files either type through the IRS, calculates the additional tax owed, and issues an updated stamped Schedule 1 within minutes of acceptance.</p>
